{"3033970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Chronicles:Reawakening of Evil", "steam_appid": 3033970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dark Chronicles:Reawakening of Evil&quot;</strong>is a casual game with roguelike elements. It is free to play. With no complex equipment combinations, no intricate maps, and no complicated items, it is a game you can start playing anytime. Experience intense battles through your agile controls and truly enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter of this game features multiple small maps. On these small maps, you will face demons swarming from all directions. Your goal is to: <strong>slay them relentlessly</strong>, eliminate all demons, and survive for 60 seconds. After surviving, you will obtain temporary cards that increase defense or attack. Then, continue exploring other small maps until you find the one where the BOSS resides. Defeating the BOSS rewards you with a treasure chest, which contains more powerful weapons and equipment when opened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/0d6fd54faf44ecac591fdc0e1638a7af.poster.avif?t=1767468547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/0d6fd54faf44ecac591fdc0e1638a7af.webm?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/0d6fd54faf44ecac591fdc0e1638a7af.mp4?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This intense battle royale game lets you encounter countless fierce demon warriors and demon mages. Slaughter these demons and claim victory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/ea36bb358d9ad0c0306cc7a70725cb7d.poster.avif?t=1767468547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/ea36bb358d9ad0c0306cc7a70725cb7d.webm?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/ea36bb358d9ad0c0306cc7a70725cb7d.mp4?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a staff to unleash deadly magic attacks in ice, fire, and poison elements. Freely combine various skills to boost damage and add unique effects. Each skill can be upgraded to max level, advancing into an even more powerful form!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice spells slow enemy movement, fire spells inflict massive damage, and poison spells weaken enemy defense, making them take extra damage. Craft your own art of slaughter and create a unique screen-clearing rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully defeat the BOSS or escape its assaults to obtain powerful equipment. Each equipment piece can be upgraded, with every level enhancing defense or attack for a leap in combat power. But stay vigilant! To secure treasure chests, you must spare no effort to dodge dense demon attacks and emerge victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/731701e2a539d8e601c405587ba752cf.poster.avif?t=1767468547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/731701e2a539d8e601c405587ba752cf.webm?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/731701e2a539d8e601c405587ba752cf.mp4?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can set the game language to English by following these steps: Click the &quot;Settings&quot; icon in the upper-right corner of the game interface, then change the &quot;Language&quot; option from &quot;Chinese (Simplified)&quot; to &quot;English&quot; in the settings window.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dark Chronicles:Reawakening of Evil&quot;</strong>is a casual game with roguelike elements. It is free to play. With no complex equipment combinations, no intricate maps, and no complicated items, it is a game you can start playing anytime. Experience intense battles through your agile controls and truly enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter of this game features multiple small maps. On these small maps, you will face demons swarming from all directions. Your goal is to: <strong>slay them relentlessly</strong>, eliminate all demons, and survive for 60 seconds. After surviving, you will obtain temporary cards that increase defense or attack. Then, continue exploring other small maps until you find the one where the BOSS resides. Defeating the BOSS rewards you with a treasure chest, which contains more powerful weapons and equipment when opened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/0d6fd54faf44ecac591fdc0e1638a7af.poster.avif?t=1767468547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/0d6fd54faf44ecac591fdc0e1638a7af.webm?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/0d6fd54faf44ecac591fdc0e1638a7af.mp4?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This intense battle royale game lets you encounter countless fierce demon warriors and demon mages. Slaughter these demons and claim victory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/ea36bb358d9ad0c0306cc7a70725cb7d.poster.avif?t=1767468547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/ea36bb358d9ad0c0306cc7a70725cb7d.webm?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033970/extras/ea36bb358d9ad0c0306cc7a70725cb7d.mp4?t=1767468547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a staff to unleash deadly magic attacks in ice, fire, and poison elements. Freely combine various skills to boost damage and add unique effects. Each skill can be upgraded to max level, advancing into an even more powerful form!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice spells slow enemy movement, fire spells inflict massive damage, and poison spells weaken enemy defense, making them take extra damage. Craft your own art of slaughter and create a unique screen-clearing rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully defeat the BOSS or escape its assaults to obtain powerful equipment. Each equipment piece can be upgraded, with every level enhancing defense or attack for a leap in combat power. But stay vigilant! To secure treasure chests, you must spare no effort to dodge dense demon attacks and emerge victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_